        "TileImage": "$($repository 7a3ae151-e302-4073-88ba-4538e7641102).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47. \rYour target is Miranda Rutherford, the current CEO of &apos;Dynasty Global&apos; and a &apos;Providence&apos; operative. She is visiting Don Yates retirement party, which is a perfect opportunity. After she witnessed the former CEO being pushed of the roof by the VP, she quickly rose to the top of the company. Being a &apos;Providence&apos; asset, she need to be eliminated to prevent &apos;Providene&apos; from forming again. \rEliminate the target, avoiding all collateral damages.\rGood luck 47.\rMission status: ACTIVE",
